                <invention-title lang="de">VERFAHREN UND VORRICHTUNG ZUR RESSOURCENAUSWAHL UND ZUM SENDEN VON PSSCH IN EINEM DRAHTLOSKOMMUNIKATIONSSYSTEM
</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">PROCÉDÉ ET DISPOSITIF DE SÉLECTION DE RESSOURCE ET DE TRANSMISSION DE PSSCH DANS UN SYSTÈME DE COMMUNICATION SANS FIL</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">METHOD AND DEVICE FOR SELECTING RESOURCE AND TRANSMITTING PSSCH IN WIRELESS COMMUNICATION SYSTEM</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A method of a sidelink User Equipment (UE) in a wireless communication system is proposed, which comprises: performing, by the LTE, sensing in a sensing window; based on the sensing, selecting, by the LTE, a transmission resource in a selection window; and transmitting, by the LTE, a PSSCH (Physical Sidelink Shared Channel) via the transmission resource; wherein one or more resources are excluded from the selection window based on a counter and a reservation period, wherein a range for a selection of the counter depends on the reservation period, and wherein a first range for a reservation period less than 100 ms is configured to be larger than a second range for a reservation period equal to 100 ms.</p>
            </abstract>
